WEBVTT

00:00:02.421 --> 00:00:04.796
DeepTech Engineering presents Sarawat:

00:00:04.856 --> 00:00:08.064
terroir intelligence for the Saudi coffee industry.

00:00:09.518 --> 00:00:12.801
Operations opens on the Kingdom's eight producing estates.

00:00:12.861 --> 00:00:15.106
Two thousand eight hundred hectares, and

00:00:15.166 --> 00:00:17.354
every drop of irrigation accounted for.

00:00:17.534 --> 00:00:20.708
The map is a live relief model of the Sarawat range.

00:00:20.768 --> 00:00:22.947
Click an estate for its full record.

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:26.189
Expansion is where the model earns its keep.

00:00:26.249 --> 00:00:30.516
Twenty parcels ranked, each paired to the Yemen district it most resembles.

00:00:32.482 --> 00:00:34.659
Jabal Al Qahar scores ninety one.

00:00:34.719 --> 00:00:37.302
A seventy seven percent match to Haraz.

00:00:37.482 --> 00:00:40.689
Yemen's twelve heritage districts are the reference:

00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:43.517
cup scores, rainfall, and ten years of yield.

00:00:44.541 --> 00:00:46.611
Compare any pair factor by factor.

00:00:46.671 --> 00:00:48.616
Then read the crop's whole year:

00:00:48.676 --> 00:00:52.125
flowering, bean fill, harvest, and monthly water demand.

00:00:52.306 --> 00:00:54.028
Every weight is yours to move.

00:00:54.088 --> 00:00:57.177
Change what matters, and the ranking changes with it.

00:00:58.904 --> 00:00:59.682
Sarawat.

00:00:59.742 --> 00:01:01.618
By DeepTech Engineering.
